Description: MiniOS image composition backend (minios-image-compose)
 minios-image-compose composes a bootable MiniOS ISO image from an immutable or
 identity-bound MiniOS source reference, ordered .sb modules and a live
 configuration. It grafts inputs in place, applies verified boot, branding and
 overlay customization, can integrate writable-session captures produced by
 savechanges, and structurally verifies the written image.
 .
 This package ships the unprivileged minios-image-compose command, used both
 directly and as the composition backend for the MiniOS Image Builder graphical
 workspace.

Package: minios-image-builder
Architecture: all
