Recommends: minios-tools (>= 1.6.3), policykit-1-gnome | lxpolkit, udisks2
Description: customize the running MiniOS as a verified bootable image
 MiniOS Image Builder is a GTK project workspace for remastering MiniOS from
 the running session, a mounted ISO image, or an optical disc. It composes .sb
 modules, applies allowlisted system, security and boot defaults, can add a
 safe project filesystem layer, and optionally captures writable-session
 changes. A narrow privilege boundary reads a root-only live configuration and
 optionally captures session state. Every image is reviewed,
 structurally verified, and published atomically.
 .
 The graphical workspace drives the minios-image-compose command from the
 minios-image-compose package and never source-builds MiniOS.
